      "reason": "The explained variance and regression patterns are computed offline from monthly-mean `tos`, so the variance-based numbers inherit the monthly-averaging caveat and must be described accordingly.",
      "status": "condensed",
      "notes": [
        "The 1950-2014 monthly climatology is the plain mean of each calendar month across years; day weights do not enter a monthly climatology (`compute_anomaly_vs_own_climatology` builds it so)."
      ]
    },
